{"2870910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Largo", "steam_appid": 2870910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870910/extras/3a866a44445c5cfc41dd26c349a4b882.poster.avif?t=1781608584\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870910/extras/3a866a44445c5cfc41dd26c349a4b882.webm?t=1781608584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870910/extras/3a866a44445c5cfc41dd26c349a4b882.mp4?t=1781608584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Largo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Largo is an anomaly observation game where you take on the role of a security surveillence officer and hunt anomalies in various locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world with an eerie post-apocalyptic atmosphere where humanity has disappeared without a trace. As a survivor, your task is to examine different abandoned and liminal spaces, and report anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay vigilant for unexpected guests and make it through to dawn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Report hundreds of anomalies across four dilapidated settings. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Click on objects to file a report</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Select from four levels of difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Encounter a wide array of anomalies, from the easily noticeable to those that are incredibly subtle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face entities in various chilling scenarios </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Earn Steam Achievements for finishing the Nightmare mode and reporting Special Anomalies</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870910/extras/3a866a44445c5cfc41dd26c349a4b882.poster.avif?t=1781608584\" width=640 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870910/extras/3a866a44445c5cfc41dd26c349a4b882.webm?t=1781608584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870910/extras/3a866a44445c5cfc41dd26c349a4b882.mp4?t=1781608584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Largo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Largo is an anomaly observation game where you take on the role of a security surveillence officer and hunt anomalies in various locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world with an eerie post-apocalyptic atmosphere where humanity has disappeared without a trace. As a survivor, your task is to examine different abandoned and liminal spaces, and report anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay vigilant for unexpected guests and make it through to dawn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Report hundreds of anomalies across four dilapidated settings. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Click on objects to file a report</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Select from four levels of difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Encounter a wide array of anomalies, from the easily noticeable to those that are incredibly subtle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face entities in various chilling scenarios </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Earn S